{"04396b1f": "言|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3561aaaf": "丰|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "494bc02b": "富|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f1a037a3": "晴|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "299d69cb": "搬|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1b5feec1": "伞|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b555dc2f": "冰|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "13599629": "化|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "73589a49": "叶|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "9c491cd4": "妙|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "43795db9": "细|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "46338705": "观|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "5a4bdaee": "察|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "47a0bf05": "懂|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4ea35cdb": "言字旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "537fc2e9": "竖|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "2fcd9c4a": "宝盖头|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "cb32283c": "日字旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "22765bb7": "提手旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "af7e6d8e": "人字头|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a18631be": "两点水|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0e3b57ed": "单人旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0e5b62ba": "口字旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0278548a": "女字旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1556f0cf": "绞丝旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b7679973": "又字旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4700430d": "竖心旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0f0caaf1": "小猫正在晒太阳呢。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "50f3644b": "外面正在下雪呢。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "752e9b5b": "爸爸正在做饭呢。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ac6bd38a": "弟弟正在画画呢。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c1d11872": "小鸟正在树上唱歌呢。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c148404a": "树上小鸟正在唱歌呢。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "65981738": "青蛙正在河边叫呢。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e4efe89b": "我们正在观察小蜗牛呢。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b827897d": "外面正在刮大风呢。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "72aa6468": "语言|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a1f9cddb": "丰收|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "6c2efed9": "丰富|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e98e033e": "晴天|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ff767ac7": "搬家|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0894446b": "雨伞|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "edaa8de8": "冰块|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a2c1c2a3": "变化|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b335f17e": "树叶|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "17ecf62d": "奇妙|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b17ee60e": "细心|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "91c2e60a": "观看|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "5da4ab2e": "观察|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "6492cf18": "看懂|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "16241f3a": "今天是晴天，老师带我们去公园观察大自然。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "01fd4459": "妈妈说下午可能会下雨，让我把雨伞放进书包。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "43bdbfbf": "老师说，小动物不会说话，可是它们也有自己的语言。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "14144d6e": "我捡起一片红红的树叶，上面有很多细细的线。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e28cb90e": "老师说，秋天到了，树叶的颜色有了变化。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "bc254c3f": "我拿着放大镜，细心地看一只小蜗牛。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "067fedb2": "小蜗牛背着它的家，好像在搬家一样。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "cd2dad1d": "我们又观察了一会儿池塘里的小鱼。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7d7d7e50": "中午很热，老师给我们每人一杯放了冰块的果汁。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "9dd0f58d": "公园旁边的苹果树结满了果子，今年真是个丰收年！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "93859139": "池塘边的小花有红的、黄的、白的，颜色真丰富。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "8d8187ff": "大自然真奇妙，有那么多有意思的东西。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "256f1ade": "晚上，我们一家人一起观看了一个讲小动物的节目。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c3c416a8": "我把今天看到的都画了下来，连妹妹都看懂了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "417a5327": "Bingo!|en-US-AvaNeural|-12%"}